# the Noise page (SAVE: a tap, the page; again, it stays): Density (the groove's hits), Air (the hiss under it), Tone
# (-50..+50 around the piece's own) and Decay (how long the hits ring; the level on OCT-/OCT+, Drift the recipes'), ALGORITHM its character (Vinyl, Tape, Dust, Room, Machine); the spectrum in the middle; SAVE held nudges it,
# held on shakes it (another character); kept by the piece; saving on GLO held and Setup's KNOB 4; a 1.2.0 project
# (format 10) read, the noise from the recipes
listen
wait 2000
tap SAVE
wait 400
expect view 19
said Noise page, character Vinyl: Density 0, Air 0, Tone 0, Decay 50
shot noise.png
spin K3 22
wait 300
said Tone +20
expect par106 20
spin K4 -15
wait 300
said Decay 35
expect par120 35
spin K2 -7
wait 300
said Air -5
expect par108 -5
spin K1 12
wait 300
said Density +10
expect par107 10
turn ALGO 1
wait 300
said NOISE Tape
expect par110 1
wait 3000
expect peak_db_max -0.5
tap SAVE
wait 200
expect view 21
said Noise space page, character Tape: Width 50, Plate 50, Echo 50, LFO 25
tap HOME
wait 300
expect view 0
# Fog's recipe: Tape, a darker, roomier, more restless noise
turn PRESET 3
wait 500
expect par110 1
expect par106 -10
expect par109 10
# SAVE held: a nudge to the noise; held on, a shake (another character); ARP's touch only the pings
press SAVE
wait 700
release SAVE
wait 300
said NOISE NUDGE
expect view 19
press SAVE
wait 1800
release SAVE
wait 300
said NOISE SHAKE
expect par110 !=1
tap HOME
wait 300
press ARP
wait 700
release ARP
wait 300
said PINGS NUDGE
said_none NOISE
# kept by a save (GLO held); Setup's KNOB 4 saves too
turn PRESET -3
wait 500
expect par110 1
expect par106 20
press GLO
wait 600
release GLO
reboot
wait 1000
expect format 17
expect par110 1
expect par106 20
# a 1.2.0 project (format 10): read, everything kept (Basic's chord level, set to 50 here), the noise from the
# recipes (Basic's: Vinyl, 0; Fog's: Tape)
tap SEL
key w5 down
spin K1 -100
spin K1 50
key w5 up
tap SEL
expect par0 50
store10
reboot
wait 1000
expect format 17
expect par111 70
expect par113 100
expect par0 50
expect par110 0
expect par106 0
turn PRESET 3
wait 500
expect par110 1
expect par106 -10
# Setup's KNOB 4: Save, a turn saves (Saved once done)
tap GLO
wait 300
expect view 6
spin K2 1
wait 300
expect dirty 1
spin K4 1
wait 300
said SAVED
expect dirty 0
